{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Those who plot evil</b> — who plan to deceive, and they are those who send strife; and it is from the root חרש. Evil at all times — strife he will send." "<b>And those who counsel peace</b> — between a man and his fellow joy will come; a hint to the joy of salvations."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:24.073722850Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}